==Strategy==
While this stage might seem intimidating at first glance, it's actually very easy to beat. All you need for this stage is [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] as meatshields with some reliable ranged attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]]. If you struggle against the Doge Darks, bring any [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark]] attackers you may have, such as [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Ring Girl Cat]]. Note that attempting to push back the Doge Darks using [[Knockback]] from units such as [[Tin Cat (Rare Cat)|Tin Cat]] will only cause them to rebound and hit your units almost immediately.

If you him, [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] can one-shot the Duches and St. Pigge the 2nd at level 12 or above.

